{"id":"ada70e665488a6bd","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-lem-hartogs-number.md","title":"Hartogs Number","display":"lem-hartogs-number — Hartogs Number","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-hartogs-number","aliases":["58-lem-hartogs-number","Hartogs Number Lemma"],"display":"lem-hartogs-number — Hartogs Number","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-injection.md]]","[[../batch19/58-ax-rep.md]]","[[../batch17/58-ax-pow.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-hartogs-number"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-hartogs-number</span><span>Hartogs Number Lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-hartogs-number — Hartogs Number"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" href=\"?note=f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-injection.md\">../batch11/58-df-injection.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b72c632f5deae9c3\" href=\"?note=b72c632f5deae9c3\" title=\"../batch19/58-ax-rep.md\">../batch19/58-ax-rep.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"15c6d7516a16816c\" href=\"?note=15c6d7516a16816c\" title=\"../batch17/58-ax-pow.md\">../batch17/58-ax-pow.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\operatorname{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injection}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Injection}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" href=\"?note=f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-injection.md\">../batch11/58-df-injection.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:V\\to\\{\\alpha\\in V:\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\}\">\\(h:V\\to\\{\\alpha\\in V:\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\}\\)</span> (metalinguistic Hartogs-number class function)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}hartogs\\text{-}number}\\vdash\n\\left[\\exists!\\alpha\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\land\\neg\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Injection}_S(f,\\alpha,X)\n\\land\n\\forall\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\;\\exists g\\;\\mathrm{Injection}_S(g,\\beta,X)\n\\Bigr)\\right]\n\\land h(X)=\n\\min\\{\\alpha\\mid\n\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\land\\neg\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Injection}_S(f,\\alpha,X)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}hartogs\\text{-}number}\\vdash\n\\left[\\exists!\\alpha\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\land\\neg\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Injection}_S(f,\\alpha,X)\n\\land\n\\forall\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\;\\exists g\\;\\mathrm{Injection}_S(g,\\beta,X)\n\\Bigr)\\right]\n\\land h(X)=\n\\min\\{\\alpha\\mid\n\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\land\\neg\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Injection}_S(f,\\alpha,X)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The unique least such ordinal is denoted <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(X)\">\\(h(X)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>This injection-based formulation is valid in ZF even when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> is not well-orderable.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-injection.md","status":"resolved","id":"f5a60b2c6e668b3e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-injection.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-ax-rep.md","status":"resolved","id":"b72c632f5deae9c3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-ax-rep.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-ax-pow.md","status":"resolved","id":"15c6d7516a16816c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-ax-pow.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ordinal}\\subseteq V$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-injection.md","status":"resolved","id":"f5a60b2c6e668b3e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Injection}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-injection.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ordinal}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Injection}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"h:V\\to\\{\\alpha\\in V:\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}hartogs\\text{-}number}\\vdash\n\\